1Ki 22:1 , Ahab, seduced by false prophets, according to the word of Micaiah, is slain at Ramoth-gilead;
1Ki 22:37 , The dogs lick up his blood, and Ahaziah succeeds him;
1Ki 22:41 , Jehoshaphat's good reign;
1Ki 22:45 , His acts;
1Ki 22:46 , Jehoram succeeds him;
1Ki 22:51 , Ahaziah's evil reign.
